        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: My First Mister, Roseanne\n- People: Carol Kane, Michael McKean, John Goodman, Desmond Harrington\n- Awards: Golden Globe Award for Best Actor\n- Roles: Dan Conner\n\nFacts:\n- From 1988 to 1997, John Goodman was best known early in his career for playing Dan Conner on the ABC television series Roseanne.\n- In 1993, John Goodman won a Golden Globe Award for Best Actor for his performance on Roseanne.\n- John Goodman co-starred in the film My First Mister alongside Carol Kane, Michael McKean, and Desmond Harrington.",
